# Machine alert sources for bin/alert-prune, one per line.
#
# Each line is matched as a substring of the From header, case-insensitively,
# the same way the Sieve rules match. Mail from these senders is moved out of
# INBOX into INBOX/system once it is older than --days (default 30).
#
# Copy this file to mailboxes/<your-mailbox>/alert-senders and list your own
# monitoring sources. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# monitoring.example.com
# alerts@example.com
